@startuml get-manager-dashboard-coffee-chat
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title GET /api/manager/v1/dashboard/coffee-chat
caption CRB-92 · 어드민 홈 대시보드 — 커피챗 요청 퍼널과 월별 추이. 읽기 전용, 기존 테이블만 집계 (신규 테이블 · 컬럼 없음). 개인정보를 내려주지 않아 access-log는 남기지 않음. 커피챗 요청 이력은 요청자가 탈퇴해도 그대로 셈

actor Client
participant "ManagerGuard" as Guard
participant "ValidationPipe" as Pipe
participant "ManagerDashboardController" as Controller
participant "ManagerDashboardService" as Service
participant "AdminDashboardRepository" as Repository
database PostgreSQL

Client -> Guard: GET /api/manager/v1/dashboard/coffee-chat?range=30d\nAuthorization: Bearer <manager token>
ref over Client, Guard: ManagerGuard — flow/manager-guards.puml\n401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token / Manager not found
Guard -> Pipe: 통과 (admin · superadmin 모두 조회 가능)
alt range 검증 실패 (7d · 30d · 90d 중 하나, 생략하면 30d)
  Pipe -[#red]-> Client: 400 (class-validator 메시지)
end
Pipe -> Controller: getCoffeeChat(query)
Controller -> Service: getCoffeeChat(range)
note right of Service
  range는 퍼널에만 적용. 월별 추이는 range와 무관하게 최근 6개월 (Asia/Seoul 월 경계)
end note
Service -> Repository: coffeeChatFunnel(from = now - range), monthlyRequests(6개월)
par 동시에 조회
  Repository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT count(*) 요청 수, count(graduated_viewed_at) 현업자 확인,\ncount(accepted_at) 수락, count(contact_shared_at) 연락처 공유, count(student_viewed_at) 재학생 확인\nFROM coffee_chat_request WHERE created_at >= from
else
  Repository -> PostgreSQL: 단계 간 평균 소요시간\navg(graduated_viewed_at - created_at), avg(accepted_at - graduated_viewed_at), avg(contact_shared_at - accepted_at)
else
  Repository -> PostgreSQL: 방치 요청 수 (기준 3일)\n미확인: graduated_viewed_at IS NULL AND created_at < now - 3 days\n수락 대기: graduated_viewed_at < now - 3 days AND accepted_at IS NULL
else
  Repository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT date_trunc('month', created_at AT TIME ZONE 'Asia/Seoul') AS month, count(*)\nFROM coffee_chat_request WHERE created_at >= 최근 6개월 시작 GROUP BY month ORDER BY month
end
PostgreSQL --> Repository: 집계 결과
Repository --> Service: 원시 집계값
note right of Service
  전환율은 서비스에서 계산 (분모 0이면 null, 0%로 내리지 않음)
  월별 추이는 요청이 없는 달도 0으로 채워 6개월을 모두 내려줌
end note
Service --> Controller: ManagerDashboardCoffeeChatDto
Controller --> Client: 200 {\n  range, generated_at,\n  funnel: { requested, graduated_viewed, accepted, contact_shared, student_viewed,\n    rates: { viewed, accepted, contact_shared }, avg_hours: { to_viewed, to_accepted, to_shared },\n    stale: { unviewed_3d, unaccepted_3d } },\n  monthly_requests: [{ month, count }] (6개)\n}

@enduml
